  "description": "Reproducible omission and rounding analyses showing how site composition changes soil cadmium depth comparisons in compiled cacao data. Original project code, documentation and newly computed reference outputs are dedicated under CC0-1.0. Third-party measurements, publications and dependencies retain their original terms; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.",
